  m_Name: Janitor Letter Q
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: 
  Speaker: 
  lines:
  - 'Detective: So, Mr Antonio I found this note in your janitorial room care to
    explain why some one asked you to kill Mr James.'
  - 'Antonio: No no no, you got that wrong it I was not meant to kill him just make
    him sick so that he could not perform in front of my real boss. Reason being
    Mr James has been losing his touch in performing for people and my boss does
    not like that.'
